ontrol of the chamber next year.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Borussia Dortmund bows to fan pressure and end Rheinmetall deal</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:9b793914863f9f2f948c8906f3919189b7d39ccc6f356fd16bbccad61cf84cc4</id><updated>2026-11-18T17:23:15Z</updated><published>2026-11-18T15:39:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/borussia-dortmund-bows-to-fan-pressure-and-end-rheinmetall-deal/a-79980121--2c9b64a964f9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/borussia-dortmund-bows-to-fan-pressure-and-end-rheinmetall-deal/a-79980121?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Borussia Dortmund has reluctantly ended its association with a major sponsor after long-term fan protests. They are not the first Bundesliga club to u-turn, as commercial interests clash with politics and fan culture.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>North Korea expanded uranium enrichment plant, says IAEA head</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:fba2d00c63a241facdf3e759940af3befc5a3b5474697d68507e8b840db2d51d</id><updated>2026-11-18T17:23:18Z</updated><published>2026-11-18T15:15:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/north-korea-expanded-uranium-enrichment-plant-says-iaea-head/a-79982758--65619f1023d6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/north-korea-expanded-uranium-enrichment-plant-says-iaea-head/a-79982758?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">IAEA chief Rafael Grossi has said the ongoing expansion of North Korea's uranium enrichment program remains "a cause for serious concern."</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>'Coalition of the Willing' meets in Berlin: In an era of waning support, Europe remains committed to Ukraine</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:2eded031720f93eb2bd4854520349b5e8c59f3c4beadfe49b01f725015057b8d</id><updated>2026-11-18T17:23:22Z</updated><published>2026-11-18T15:0