s were targeted overnight in Krasnodar, after the Kerch bridge was put out of action by Ukrainian strikes.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>India news: Gandhi gives talk in New York, warns of 'looming crisis'</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:d11a9576e411a0ecf716ccfb7373829ff81e1c92a529241f43c84784ad7d1145</id><updated>2026-11-18T17:22:14Z</updated><published>2026-11-18T07:03:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/india-news-gandhi-gives-talk-in-new-york-warns-of-looming-crisis/live-79976447--c189b72db73b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/india-news-gandhi-gives-talk-in-new-york-warns-of-looming-crisis/live-79976447?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Indian opposition leader Rahul Gandhi's US remarks on the economy drew a BJP counterattack. Meanwhile, the Quad leaders pushed back on moves to undermine regional peace,</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>US Democrats flip Alaska Senate seat as Mary Peltola wins race</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:cfb277de8770a5c1a9cce763c8b4560bba82370cc6fdf45754ad749aaf6296f1</id><updated>2026-11-18T17:22:14Z</updated><published>2026-11-18T06:27:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/us-democrats-flip-alaska-senate-seat-as-mary-peltola-wins-race/a-79976628--01b72bede9ae.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/us-democrats-flip-alaska-senate-seat-as-mary-peltola-wins-race/a-79976628?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The US Senate's final outstanding midterm election race has been won by Mary Peltola. She unseats Republican Dan Sullivan after winning 50.1% of the vote.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>APEC summit: What Trump, Xi and Putin want</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e607961938060d798f128067846bbb694492590591c4300ed7e0975fc8eafadc</id><updated>2026-11-18T17:22:14Z</updated><published>2026-11-18T05:39:00Z</p