co has been under fire over his ties to Russia. The rallies were held on the anniversary of the 1989 Velvet Revolution that toppled communism in Czechoslovakia.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Nvidia beats Q3 expectations in first report post-Jensen Huang</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:6ef2deb9278368c4fdecdbbe70cf4bcbb97539e9c1e6d80ae342dc4ffbe78522</id><updated>2026-11-18T17:22:14Z</updated><published>2026-11-18T00:34:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/nvidia-beats-q3-expectations-in-first-report-post-jensen-huang/a-79975683--ca82798dd36d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/nvidia-beats-q3-expectations-in-first-report-post-jensen-huang/a-79975683?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The AI chipmaker said it doubled its third-quarter revenue and confirmed that Jensen Huang would not be reinstated as CEO after a Chinese spy scandal.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Hashim Thaci's second conviction in The Hague reignites debate in Kosovo about justice and the Kosovo Specialist Chambers</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:99024df01f2aa52db465b5840475273d546cb62550800a5c94cd3e0cc9b4ed4e</id><updated>2026-11-18T17:22:14Z</updated><published>2026-11-17T20:40:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/hashim-thaci-s-second-conviction-in-the-hague-reignites-debate-in-kosovo-about-justice-and-the-kosov/a-79975227--3db3936546e0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/hashim-thaci-s-second-conviction-in-the-hague-reignites-debate-in-kosovo-about-justice-and-the-kosovo-specialist-chambers/a-79975227?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Former President Hashim Thaci has been convicted of trying to influence witnesses in his war crimes trial. The conviction has reignited debate in Kosovo about the Kosovo Specialist Chambers, the court that convicted him.</summary><category term="Wo